msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/cart.rst:86
msgid ""
"You can enable the 'Buy Now' button to instantly take the customer to "
"**checkout** instead of adding the product to the cart. The :guilabel:`Buy "
"Now` button is an *additional* button and does not replace "
"the :guilabel:`Add to Cart` button. To enable it, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings --> Shop - "
"Checkout Process` and tick :guilabel:`Buy Now`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/cart.rst:None
msgid "Buy Now button"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/cart.rst:97
msgid "Re-order from portal"
msgstr "Uudelleentilaus portaalista"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/cart.rst:99
msgid ""
"Customers have the possibility to **re-order** items from **previous sales "
"orders** on the customer portal. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"Configuration --> Settings --> Shop - Checkout Process` and "
"enable :guilabel:`Re-order From Portal`. Customers can find "
"the :guilabel:`Order Again` button on their **sales order** from the "
"**customer portal**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/cart.rst:None
